cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ADS-Bench in your research, please cite both this repository and the accompanying preprint."
title: "ADS-Bench v2.0: A Multi-Architecture Benchmark for Neuro-Symbolic LLM Control of Physical Vapor Deposition Systems"
abstract: >-
  ADS-Bench v2.0 evaluates language-model agents across 46 tasks (40 short tasks across five cognitive
  and safety tiers plus 6 live deposition and recipe-audit capstones) on three open physical vapor
  deposition (PVD) architectures in APS Control Community v1.7.1: single-chamber batch sputtering
  (Sputter), load-locked multi-source sputtering (ADS), and multi-chamber radial cluster sputtering
  (Cluster). Includes frozen wire receipts, deterministic capstone scorers, campaign execution harness,
  and leakage-free synthetic topology SFT/DPO training scripts.
